%%HP: T(3)A(D)F(.);
\<<
  IFERR STD CLEAR
"Enter coefficients of
dividend and divisor:"
{
":dividend: {}
:divisor : {"
{ 1 13 } } INPUT
OBJ\-> DTAG DUP 1 GET
OVER SIZE \-> D T N
    \<< DTAG { } SWAP
DUP SIZE N - 1 + 1
SWAP
      START DUP 1
GET T / COLCT ROT
OVER 1 \->LIST + 3
ROLLD 1 N
        FOR M OVER
M GET D M GET 3
PICK * - ROT M ROT
PUT SWAP
        NEXT DROP 2
100 SUB
      NEXT D
"Divisor" \->TAG SWAP
"Remainder" \->TAG 3
ROLL "Quotient"
\->TAG
    \>>
  THEN BAD
  END
\>>
